  ('Experience Watercolours!!!', 'EXPERIENCE WATERCOLOURSFall classes begin:Gabriola Beginner:Saturdays, Oct 17 through November 28, 1:30 – 3:30Gabriola Fellowship Church7, 2 hour sessions for $250Gabriola Intermediate:Saturdays, October 17 through November 28, 10am – noonGabriola Fellowship Church7, 2 hour sessions for $250', '2026-10-17'::date, '2026-11-28'::date, '10:00:00'::time, '12:00:00'::time, false, 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', '775 Church Street', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/experience-watercolours-1915695', false),
