  ('Soup Social (PHC)', 'Soup Socials provide delicious and nutritional meals in a casual setting. This is an event within the community to share a meal which fosters social connection and strengthens relationships. Join us and see what interesting conversation you can engage in with your fellow neighbors. Drop-in, all ages. Dates: Tuesdays, 11am-1pm. Location: Summer: Commons (main floor), 675 North Rd. Winter: Fellowship Church, 775 Church St (approx second week of Oct). Cost: FREE or by donation', '2026-10-20'::date, '2026-10-20'::date, '11:00:00'::time, '13:00:00'::time, false, 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', '775 Church Street', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/soup-social-phc-1884338', true),
