  ('Adult Day Program (PHC)', 'Provides engaging therapeutic activities for individuals experiencing physical, cognitive or social challenges in a safe, supervised environment. Our person-centered programs are developed to offer an opportunity for participants to connect with each other, while also offering respite for caregivers. Dates: Mondays and Fridays, 11:30am-2:30pm. Location: Rollo Seniors Centre, 685 North Rd. Age: 60+ (flexible). Cost: FREE or by donation. Registration required. Participants must complete an Island Health intake assessment. For any questions, please contact seniorsmanager@phcgabriola.org', '2026-11-02'::date, '2026-11-02'::date, '11:30:00'::time, '14:30:00'::time, false, 'Rollo Centre', 'Rollo Centre', '685 North Road', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/adult-day-program-phc-1884585', true),
  ('Ladies Badminton @ The Community Hall', '2pm-4pm. all levels welcome. Join us for fun, casual badminton games open to all skill levels. No registration or partner required, just drop in, meet new people, and enjoy the game!', '2026-11-02'::date, '2026-11-02'::date, '14:00:00'::time, '16:00:00'::time, false, 'Gabriola Community Hall', 'Gabriola Community Hall', '2200 South Road', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/ladies-badminton-the-community-hall-1460261', true),
