  ('Grief Circle Support Group', 'Meets bi-weekly at the Fellowship Church Tuesdays 2-3:30pm Facilitated Peer Support Group Our Grief Circle is a welcoming, supportive space where community members can come together to share, listen, and move through grief alongside others who understand loss. Please pre-register (see the original listing)', '2026-11-03'::date, '2026-11-03'::date, '14:00:00'::time, '15:30:00'::time, false, 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', 'Gabriola Fellowship Church', '775 Church Street', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/grief-circle-support-group-1902960', true),
