  ('Beginner Ukulele Instruction and Singalong', 'Downstairs in the Gabriola Community Hall on Monday evenings from 6pm-8pm. Beginner ukulele: 6-7pm. Sing along and play along: 7-8pm (with a uke or whatever!). Suggested donation = $5', '2026-11-23'::date, '2026-11-23'::date, '18:00:00'::time, '20:00:00'::time, false, 'Gabriola Community Hall', 'Gabriola Community Hall', '2200 South Road', 'Gabriola Island', NULL, NULL, 'Gabriola Events directory', 'https://directory.gabriolaevents.ca/gabriola-events/Details/beginner-ukulele-instruction-and-singalong-1887097', false),
